<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span>
        <h1>Four Ways to Get Found, Chosen and Scaled</h1>
        <p class="lead">We don&rsquo;t sell hours or pages. We deliver four clearly defined solutions, each with a fixed scope, clear KPIs and one accountable team, so SaaS &amp; Ecommerce leaders always know what they&rsquo;re buying and what it will achieve.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__media reveal" data-delay="1">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/assets/data-warehouse.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/assets/data-warehouse.jpg" alt="Data flowing from sources through processing into analytics" width="1024" height="768" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container prose-block">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Why Named Solutions, Not a Service List</h2></div>
      <p class="text-center reveal" style="font-size:1.1rem;">Most agencies offer a long menu and leave you to assemble the pieces. We built four connected solutions around the outcomes our clients care about most: visibility in search and AI, qualified demand, and the operational capacity to handle growth.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid--2">
        <article class="card card--feature solution-card reveal" data-delay="0">
          <div class="solution-card__head"><span class="solution-card__num">01</span><span class="tag tag--plain">Free</span></div>
          <h3>AI Visibility Audit</h3>
          <p><strong>What it is:</strong> A clear benchmark of how Google, ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity currently describe, mention and recommend your brand compared with your competitors.</p>
          <p><strong>What you get:</strong> Your AI visibility snapshot, the gaps holding you back, and a prioritised action plan.</p>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Any SaaS or Ecommerce brand that wants to know where it stands before investing.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/ai-visibility-audit">Get your free audit &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card--feature solution-card reveal" data-delay="1">
          <div class="solution-card__head"><span class="solution-card__num">02</span></div>
          <h3>Answer-Ready Website</h3>
          <p><strong>What it is:</strong> AI web development that delivers a fast, secure, conversion-focused website, built from day one to rank in search and to be understood and cited by AI assistants.</p>
          <p><strong>What you get:</strong> Strategy, design, engineering, schema and launch, typically in three to six weeks.</p>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Brands whose current website is slow, dated or invisible in AI answers.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/ai-services/ai-web-development">Explore AI Web Development &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card--feature solution-card reveal" data-delay="0">
          <div class="solution-card__head"><span class="solution-card__num">03</span></div>
          <h3>AI Visibility Programme</h3>
          <p><strong>What it is:</strong> AI-powered SEO, Answer Engine Optimization, Generative Engine Optimization and schema markup, run as one monthly programme with one goal: more visibility and more qualified demand from search and AI.</p>
          <p><strong>What you get:</strong> Technical fixes, answer-first content, entity and schema work, and third-party presence, with monthly reporting on rankings, AI share of voice and leads.</p>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Brands ready to compete for their category in Google and AI assistants.</p>
          <p class="solution-card__links"><a class="link" href="/ai-services/answer-engine-optimization">AEO</a> &middot; <a class="link" href="/ai-services/ai-seo">AI SEO</a> &middot; <a class="link" href="/ai-services/generative-engine-optimization">GEO</a> &middot; <a class="link" href="/ai-services/schema-markup">Schema</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="card card--feature solution-card reveal" data-delay="1">
          <div class="solution-card__head"><span class="solution-card__num">04</span></div>
          <h3>Dedicated Data Operations Pod&trade;</h3>
          <p><strong>What it is:</strong> A dedicated specialist (160 hours a month) backed by QA, SOPs, weekly KPI reports and a named account manager.</p>
          <p><strong>What you get:</strong> Data entry, CRM updates, enrichment, research, database cleanup, back-office tasks and non-voice support, handled to an agreed quality standard.</p>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Teams whose growth is slowed by repetitive data work.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/data-operations">Explore the Pod &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Better Together</h2><p>The solutions are designed to connect.</p></div>
      <ol class="ai-steps ai-steps--3">
        <li class="ai-step reveal"><span class="ai-step__num">1</span><h3>See Where You Stand</h3><p>The AI Visibility Audit shows how search and AI engines see your brand today.</p></li>
        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="1"><span class="ai-step__num">2</span><h3>Become Visible</h3><p>The Answer-Ready Website and AI Visibility Programme make you the brand engines find and recommend.</p></li>
        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="2"><span class="ai-step__num">3</span><h3>Scale to Meet Demand</h3><p>The Data Operations Pod gives your team the capacity to convert the demand that follows.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-center reveal" style="margin-top:28px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);">One partner, from first search to fulfilled order.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-band__grid reveal">
      <div class="cta-band__text"><h2>Not Sure Where to Start?</h2><p>Begin with a free AI Visibility Audit or a free Operations Capacity Audit&trade;. Either way, you&rsquo;ll get a clear, no-obligation plan.</p></div>
      <div class="cta-band__action cta-band__action--stack"><a href="/ai-visibility-audit" class="btn btn--white btn--lg">Get Your Free AI Visibility Audit</a><a href="/capacity-audit" class="btn btn--white btn--lg">Book a Capacity Audit</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

